{"type":"event","event":{"type":"message_update","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now verify: run public test, plus a brute-force cross-check on random strings (small alphabet, including non-BMP chars like emoji to test Unicode code points), and a large-input performance test.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll verify with the public test, a brute-force cross-check (including non-BMP Unicode like emoji, which are single code points in Python), and a large-input performance test."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"[CALL_00130]","name":"shell_command","input":{"command":"cd /tmp/flashbench_glm53_t09_4016857/t09 && python test_public.py && python - <<'EOF'\nimport random, time\nfrom window import longest_unique\n\n# brute-force reference\ndef brute(text):\n    best = ''\n    for i in range(len(text)):\n        seen = set()\n        for j in range(i, len(text)):\n            if text[j] in seen:\n                break\n            seen.add(text[j])\n            if j - i + 1 > len(best):\n                best = text[i:j+1]\n    return best\n\n# tie/edge cases\ncases = ['', 'a', 'aa', 'abba', 'abca', 'abcdef', 'aaaaa', 'pwwkew', 'tmmzuxt',\n         'abab', 'abcabcbb', 'bbbbb', 'dvdf', 'abba' + 'xy']\nfor t in cases:\n    got, exp = longest_unique(t), brute(t)\n    assert got == exp, (t, got, exp)\n    # verify no repeats\n    assert len(set(got)) == len(got)\n\n# random cross-check incl. non-BMP code points and combining/astral chars\nalphabet = ['a', 'b', 'c', '😀', '🌍', 'é', '中', '\\U0010FFFF']\nfor n in range(0, 30):\n    for _ in range(200):\n        t = ''.join(random.choices(alphabet, k=n))\n        got, exp = longest_unique(t), brute(t)\n        assert got == exp, (t, got, exp)\n\n# large performance test: hundreds of thousands of chars\nbig = ''.join(random.choices('abcdefghij', k=500_000))\nt0 = time.perf_counter()\nr = longest_unique(big)\ndt = time.perf_counter() - t0\nassert len(set(r)) == len(r)\nassert r == brute(big[:2000] if len(big) > 2000 else big)  # sanity on a prefix\n# adversarial: all-distinct huge string (one giant window)\ndistinct = ''.join(chr(c) for c in range(0x110000) if not (0xD800 <= c <= 0xDFFF))\nt0 = time.perf_counter()\nr2 = longest_unique(distinct)\ndt2 = time.perf_counter() - t0\nassert r2 == distinct\n# adversarial: alternating repeats\nalt = 'ab' * 250_000\nt0 = time.perf_counter()\nr3 = longest_unique(alt)\ndt3 = time.perf_counter() - t0\nassert r3 == 'ab'\nprint(f'ALL_OK random500k={dt:.3f}s allunique1.1M={dt2:.3f}s alt500k={dt3:.3f}s')\nEOF","description":"Run public test plus brute-force and performance checks"}}]}}
